Why this is the fault:
- The failing assertion is only on `c.getCounts(uniDimIndex)`. Earlier in the same test, both the iterator state and `c.getCount(expected[i])` are validated and pass for the same index, so the forward mapping is consistent and the reverse mapping is not.
